/-!
# The ATLAS binary matrix carrier for Co₁

The subgroup of GL₂₄(2) generated by `Co1G1-f2r24B0`.
Source: R. A. Wilson et al., ATLAS of Finite Group Representations,
https://brauer.maths.qmul.ac.uk/Atlas/v3/matrep/Co1G1-f2r24B0 .
The source identifies this representation with Co₁ itself, not 2.Co₁.
Original data, provenance and reproducible transcription are in `source/`.
Matrices are transcribed row by row with no transpose or inversion; the
multiplication is ordinary matrix multiplication. Their inverse certificates
are checked by the Lean kernel. No semi-presentation defines this carrier.

This alternate sourced representation avoids requiring the separate Leech
lattice port. No isomorphism to that lattice model, order or simplicity theorem
is asserted by this construction.
-/

@[expose] public section

namespace Sporadic.LeechRelated.Co1

set_option maxRecDepth 20000
set_option maxHeartbeats 4000000

